      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵamtumile jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwawo Yehu, mwanace jwamlume jwa Hanani, kuti akasale maloŵe aga kwa Basha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“M'mweji nganimŵa kandu kose, une namkwesisye m'mwejo kuti mŵe jwakwalongolela ŵandu ŵangu ŵa ku Isalaeli. Nambo yindu yimkutenda ngamkulekangana ni yiŵatesile Yelobowamu. Soni mwalongolele ŵandu ŵangu kuti alemwe, nipo ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wawo wundumbilisye une. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinimjonanje m'mwejo pamo ni liŵasa lyenu lyosope, mpela munatendele ni liŵasa lya Yelobowamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa mwenu jutaciwila mu msinda, tacilidwa ni m'mbwa. Jwalijose jutaciwila mwitinji tacilidwa ni yijuni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basha ŵamtumbilisye AMBUJE mnope, ni ligongo lyakwe AMBUJEWO ŵamtumisye jwakulocesya Yehu ni maloŵe gelaga kwa Basha ni kwa liŵasa lyakwe lyosope. Basha ŵaliji mkwalemwecesya AMBUJE kaŵilikaŵili, pakusyasya kutenda yakusakala yiŵatendaga Yelobowamu ni ŵandu ŵakwe, ni soni kupunda pelepo jwalakwejo ŵalemwisye pakwawulaga ŵandu wosope ŵa mwiŵasa lya Yelobowamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5+1KI.16.6+1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5",
              "1KI.16.6",
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masengo gane gaŵatesile Basha ni yosope ya macili yiŵatesile piŵaliji mwenye, yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Isalaeli. Basha ŵawile nipo ŵamsicile m'malembe ga ku Tilisa. Nipo Ela mwanace jwakwe, ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5+1KI.16.6+1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5",
              "1KI.16.6",
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Ela jwa ku Isalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5+1KI.16.6+1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5",
              "1KI.16.6",
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mwanace jwa Basha, ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Isalaeli ku Tilisa, mu caka ca 26 ca ucimwene wa Asa wa ku Yuda. Nipo ŵalamulile kwa yaka yiŵilipe basi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo mundu jwine lina lyakwe Simuli, juŵaliji jwamkulungwa jwakulolela hafu lya mageleta gakwe, ŵamtendele jwalakwejo malindi. Lisiku line Ela ŵaliji ku Tilisa, ŵaliji mkumwa mpakana kukolelwa, ku nyumba ja Alisa, juŵaliji jwamkulungwa jwakulolela nyumba josope ja ucimwene ku Tilisako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simuli ŵajinjile m'Nyumbamo ni ŵamwuleje Elajo, nipo jwalakwe ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe. Yeleyi yatendekwe mu caka ca 27 ca ucimwene wa Asa wa ku Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali atandite Simuli kulamulila, ŵawuleje ŵandu wosope ŵa mwiŵasa lya Basha. Nginamlecela amta jwamlume kapena mcanda jumo, jwa mwa acalongo acimjakwe, kapena mwa acambusanga ŵakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Simuli ŵawuleje ŵandu wosope ŵa mwiŵasa lya Basha, mpela muŵaŵecetele AMBUJE, kupitila mwa Yehu jwakulocesya jula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paja Yehujo ŵamjamwice Basha ligongo lya yindu yakusakala yiŵatesile jwalakwe ni yiŵatesile Ela mwanace jwakwe. Jemanjaji ŵalongolele Aisalaeli kulemwa. Pakulambila milungu ja cilendo. Pakutenda myoyo ŵatumbilisye AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masengo gane gaŵatesile Ela piŵaliji mwenye, yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Simuli jwa ku Isalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simuli ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Isalaeli ku Tilisa, mu caka ca 27 ca ucimwene wa Mwenye Asa jwa ku Yuda. Nambo ŵalamwile kwa masiku msano ni gaŵilipe basi. Ndaŵi jelejo asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa Isalaeli ŵaliji ali awusyungulile msinda wa Afilisiti, lina lyakwe Gibitoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo asilikali ŵa ngondowo piŵapikene kuti Simuli atesile malindi nipo amwuleje mwenye, lisiku lilyolyo ali ciŵela ku masakasa gawogo, ŵamsagwile Omuli jwakulongolela jwa ngondo kuti aŵe mwenye jwa Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Omuli pamo ni asilikali ŵakwe wosope ŵa ngondo ŵatyosile ku Gibitoni kula, ni ŵajile kuwusyungulila msinda wa Tilisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simuli piŵalolite kuti msinda usumulidwe, ŵatisile kuja kwinjila mcipinda ca mkati mnope ca nyumba ja ucimwene, ni ŵajijocice nyumba ja ucimwenejo ni moto, nipo jwalakwe ŵawile mlilamba lya motolyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simuli ŵawile camti myoyo, ligongo lya ulemwa wuŵatesile pameso pa AMBUJE. Jwalakwejo ŵayikuyisye yitendo yakusakala ya Yelobowamu, ni ŵatendesye Aisalaeli kulemwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masengo gane gaŵatesile Simuli piŵaliji mwenye, pamo ni malindi giŵatesile, yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Omuli jwa ku Isalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵawile Shimuli, ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵagaŵanice, ŵane ŵamkuyisye Tibini mwanace jwa Ginati, kuti akamjinjisye ucimwene, nipo ŵane ŵiŵamkuyisye Omuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pambesi pakwe, ŵandu ŵiŵamkuyisye Omuli ŵapundile pa ngondo, Tibini ŵawile nipo Omuli ŵajinjile ucimwene wa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵajinjile ucimwene welewu mu caka ca 31 ca ucimwene wa Asa wa ku Yuda. Ŵalamulile kwa yaka 12. Yaka msano ni cimo yandanda ŵalamulile ali ku Tilisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli ŵasumile Litumbi lya Samaliya kwa mundu jwine lina lyakwe Shemeli, pa mtengo wa mbiya 6,000 sya silifa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Nipo ŵataŵile msinda pelepo ni ŵawupele lina lyakwe Samaliya, pakukuya lina lya Shemeli, msyene jwa litumbi lila jwandanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
