          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuli ŵatesile ulemwa wekulungwa pameso pa AMBUJE, ulemwa wakupunda wuŵatesile acayimwene wosope ŵakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatesile ulemwa mpela wuŵatesile Yelobowamu, pakwalongolela Aisalaeli kulemwa, ni kujilambila milungu ja cilendo. Pakutenda myoyo ŵamtumbilisye AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masengo gosope giŵatesile pamo ni ya macili gakwe, giŵalosisye Omuli piŵaliji mwenye, yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Omuli ŵawile nipo ŵamsicile m'malembe ku Samaliya. Nipo Ahabu mwanace jwakwe, ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Ahabu jwa ku Isalaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu mwanace jwa Omuli ŵajinjile ucimwene ŵa ku Isalaeli mu caka ca 38 ca ucimwene wa Asa jwa ku Yuda. Nipo ŵalamulile ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli, ni ku Samaliya kwa yaka 22. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nombe najo Ahabu ŵatesile ulemwa wawukulungwa pameso pa AMBUJE, ulemwa wakupunda wuŵatesile acayimwene wosope ŵakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe nginajikutila ni gamba kulemwa mpela muŵatendele Yelobowamu, nambo jwalakwe ŵajonjecesye kutenda ulemwa pakulombela jwamkongwe lina lyakwe Yesebele, mwanace jwa Mwenye Etibala, jwa ku Sidoni, nipo ŵatandite kulambila mlungu jwa cilendo lina lyakwe Baala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu ŵataŵile nyumba jakupopelela ni ŵapanganyisye malo gakupelecela mbopesi kwa Baala, m'Nyumba jakupopelelajo, ku Samaliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo ŵaŵisile soni mlungu jwa cilendo lina lyakwe Ashela m'Nyumba jakupopelelamo. Ahabu ŵatesile ulemwa wejinji wakwatumbilisya AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli, kulekangana ni ulemwa wuŵatesile acayimwene wosope ŵakala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
