          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa ndaŵi jeleji ja ucimwene wa Ahabu, Hiyele mundu jwa ku Beteli ŵataŵile soni msinda wa ku Yeliko. Nambo ndaŵi jiŵataŵaga Hiyele yilimbilimbi ja lipupa lya msindawo, mwanace jwakwe jwamlume jwandanda kupagwa, lina lyakwe Abilamu ŵawile. Ndaŵi jiŵamalisyaga kutaŵa yipata ya msindawo, mwanace jwakwe jwamlume jwakumalisya, lina lyakwe Segubu nombe najo ŵawile. Yindu yosopeyi yatendekwe mpela muŵaŵecetele AMBUJE kalakala, kupitila mwa Yoswa mwanace jwa Nuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
